    "detailed_description": "Unaki is an action-adventure set on a tropical island filled with cunning creatures and eager adventurers, all in search of the great treasure Unaki, unaware of the island's dark truth.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/0397f0cb0d2c5bba4f77d5613c1d03d8.poster.avif?t=1715368019\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/0397f0cb0d2c5bba4f77d5613c1d03d8.webm?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/0397f0cb0d2c5bba4f77d5613c1d03d8.mp4?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>RESPONSIVE FREE FLOW COMBAT</strong><br>- Weapon types with different abilities<br>- Chain movement-combos to travel faster<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/24ea7022168951e175a2af8af9980531.poster.avif?t=1715368019\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/24ea7022168951e175a2af8af9980531.webm?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/24ea7022168951e175a2af8af9980531.mp4?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>POWER UP WITH GEMS</strong><br>- Discover which gems work excellent when used together<br>- Be creative and find unique builds<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/c1a93aeda26caefc123ad0af9230d088.poster.avif?t=1715368019\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/c1a93aeda26caefc123ad0af9230d088.webm?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/c1a93aeda26caefc123ad0af9230d088.mp4?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>EXPLORE THE ISLAND</strong><br>- Seek out hidden secrets<br>- Uncover the island's dark truth<br>- Roam free &amp; discover new inter-connecting paths between the areas<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/1421a1c35a5767f4dbdc00114bec0a3f.poster.avif?t=1715368019\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/1421a1c35a5767f4dbdc00114bec0a3f.webm?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/1421a1c35a5767f4dbdc00114bec0a3f.mp4?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN CHARACTER</strong><br>- Multiple hairstyles<br>- Face Customization<br>- Hair/Skin/Eye colors<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/6f312c39bd8bd739db7f27e32ad8dbd5.poster.avif?t=1715368019\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/6f312c39bd8bd739db7f27e32ad8dbd5.webm?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830730/extras/6f312c39bd8bd739db7f27e32ad8dbd5.mp4?t=1715368019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>GET TO KNOW THE WORLD</strong><br>- Befriend adventurers<br>- Find untold stories<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"